>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Professionals on older stacks such as mainframe, COBOL or traditional database administration can deepen niche expertise, modernise toward cloud and data roles, or shift to adjacent roles, and since demand and pay vary by employer and region, the safe approach is to read real notices, test one new skill with a project and talk to people who moved.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

